--- !u!114 &274997598
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 274997592}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 01f4fd325be27824b909a6aaa448bca2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  InitialPostersList:
  - Name: Bands of Emotion
    Artist: Karu
    Description: A band of emotion. Reflecting the emotions of your great god.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 33f7e806407ea054fa3aaa417e53974b, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 1
  - Name: Dragonfruit Sunset
    Artist: Karu
    Description: You've never had a dragonfruit before. You hope it tastes good...
      It probably doesn't.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4826588ee66c0de4c99b1ee4bfc556a2, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 1
  - Name: Light In The Dark
    Artist: Karu
    Description: A reminder that even as things grow dark, a warm optimistic light
      shines on you.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f7c96d367f2fff44caf34fb1094636a9, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 1
  - Name: Coiling Love
    Artist: Karu
    Description: Coiling and curving lines form into a heart. It could really mean
      anything.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e861edc545e20ca4d86426a43508447f, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 1
  - Name: Creation
    Artist: Nommz
    Description: An example of extremely young earth creationsim. It's only been
      about a week...
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 492059adf81bf3043902be78b7e991e2, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Duality
    Artist: Sy
    Description: (Chaotic Alien Noises)
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c389564c6a54baa4dab081d7a005c21e, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Light
    Artist: Zyyph
    Description: My roommate made me make this.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 865929cf6eb5a7a439271e00e29b404a, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: In His Hand
    Artist: Sykes
    Description: He's got the whole world.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd1e0b45de6575c44b52e852caa7221e, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Puplo Picaso
    Artist: Karu
    Description: The voice of a nation. The face of a dog. The angles of a triangle.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 60e29a5d0248a9842a31df8add6799c9, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Slumbering God
    Artist: Karu
    Description: The only peaceful time for the city.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c182af2e617e4494382b9829fc49bef7, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Fruity
    Artist: Karu
    Description: The inspiration for a newer god.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b54d2048adf88d5428d6dd06192ff748, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Post Workout
    Artist: Karu
    Description: We're not sure why he exercises the mechanical arm, but he's very
      proud of it.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1d0ba499d8cea7c4f8e96a2ab0f7ea94, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Unanswered Prayers
    Artist: Se7en
    Description: A world consumed by haze.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: de4d00a56f6808740a475c87713c675a, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Enabler
    Artist: Se7en
    Description: He makes things happen.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9549d59254bbbc949827b1cb8f25baa6, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Burden
    Artist: Se7en
    Description: It's impossible to carry a world, but some will still try.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7a14ce2c396da4e4cbf458d15a193a3e, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: FREE MONEY
    Artist: Se7en
    Description: JUST CLICK HERE
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9e11e75931e27354b9fd2bf2ca071388, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Layers
    Artist: Boof
    Description: Above and Below
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dcc0086ad0fd1794585f7e8f87743dd7, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Voxel
    Artist: Boof
    Description: Chunky bois.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bc70335d7365a34294501e2aaac4550, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Last Fantasy
    Artist: GuiShadow
    Description: Will the three of them ever look the same direction?
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5880ead7553208847b378348075b3121, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: WoolOfWool
    Artist: DevonToTheFourth
    Description: God of wool made of wool. The world is truly cyclical.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 308c162ef9571ef42be7f69c53e20993, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Kobold Delivery
    Artist: Akari Kaen
    Description: A logo that sticks with you.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1869145f1c44e1645b467472071fe351, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Pixel Heirarchy
    Artist: Akari Kaen
    Description: Everyone has their place in the world as well as at least 25 pixels.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 11004a0b295f18e40a2b839bb5a5a3f0, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Loaf
    Artist: Catriphus
    Description: A depiction of a strange entity has entered a meditative state called
      loaf.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 56bd792732588d74dac15eb065321765, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Unanswered Corruption
    Artist: Se7en
    Description: ???
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0c8aabe12cb1b554d9be6d21e645dbb1, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Enabled Corruption
    Artist: Se7en
    Description: ???
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0e08194b10f12b04bab406d09f48a3ba, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Burden Corrupted
    Artist: Se7en
    Description: ???
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c0caf4c8bbe2ca7408a3d9ee16ff0e91, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Money Corrupted
    Artist: Se7en
    Description: ???
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1c91867747760a946bf99f63ef062cef, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Soza's Biggest Star
    Artist: Essyx
    Description: The most important dog in all of Soza!
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fba522b0cee7a0b4397b15de4f72018f, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Looming Figure
    Artist: Glitch
    Description: Even in the dark, some things are always visible. Some find it comforting,
      others see it as a constant warning.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 599f75ec3d7047b42827fba884def7c2, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: DOGma
    Artist: Mimp
    Description: The broadcast is required listening. The poster, however, is just
      highly recommended.
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 98c9b619c839b6941adcda596048ae7a, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  - Name: Cosmic God
    Artist: Rezorus
    Description: I wanted an excuse to practice perspective. I feel like the rest
      of the image came naturally from that!
    Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8fd1f2602bf732d42b08c412ac657a95, type: 3}
    Unlocked: 0
  UnlockSound: {fileID: 1956930445}
